1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,170
U bir kun davom etishi kerak bo‘lgan urushda qolib ketdi.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,690
Bu gapni Amerika prezidenti Donald Tramp Vladimir Putin haqida aytdi.

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:12,050
Yana qayerda deysizmi? Putin bilan uchrashuvdan bor-yo‘g‘i bir-ikki kun o‘tib,

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,830
Oq uyda jurnalistlar oldida.

5
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,910
Bu gap Kremlni tanqid qilishmi yoki tinchlik bitimi arafasidagi bosim?

6
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:22,350
Va eng muhimi, Ukrainadagi urush haqiqatan ham tugashga yaqinlashyaptimi?

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:26,410
Assalomu alaykum. Bugun shu savollarga faktlar asosida javob izlaymiz.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,650
Avval nima bo‘lganini aniqlab olaylik.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,950
20-noyabr, payshanba kuni Donald Tramp Xitoydan qaytdi.

10
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,610
Shenchjen shahrida Osiyo-Tinch okeani iqtisodiy hamkorlik tashkiloti,

11
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,650
ya’ni APEC sammiti bo‘lib o‘tgan edi.

12
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:42,010
U yerda Tramp Xitoy rahbari Si Szinpin bilan ham, Vladimir Putin bilan ham uchrashdi.

13
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:46,350
Qaytgach, Oq uyda matbuot anjumani o‘tkazdi va Ukraina haqida shunday dedi.

14
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:51,970
Tramp so‘zlariga ko‘ra, Putin uchrashuvda urushni diplomatik yo‘l bilan tugatish istagini aniq bildirgan.

15
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,490
Keyin u qo‘shimcha qildi:

16
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,570
«Bu oson ish emas.

17
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:58,070
Prezident Zelenskiy va prezident Putin o‘rtasida ulkan nafrat bor.

18
00:00:58,020 --> 00:01:00,410
Bunday vaziyatda hech qachon oson bo‘lmaydi».

19
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:04,770
Aynan shu matbuot anjumanida Tramp eng ko‘p iqtibos keltirilayotgan gapini aytdi.

20
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:07,510
Uning so‘zlariga ko‘ra, Putin hozir qiyin ahvolda,

21
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:10,810
chunki u bir kun davom etishi kerak bo‘lgan urushni olib bormoqda.

22
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,450
Bu urush esa allaqachon yillarga cho‘zildi.

23
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:16,090
Ba’zi OAV xabariga ko‘ra, Tramp shuningdek,

24
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:18,890
ikki yetakchi o‘rtasida bunchalik kuchli nafrat bo‘lmaganida,

25
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:21,870
urush ikki yil avval ham tugagan bo‘lishi mumkinligini aytgan.

26
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:24,590
Endi bu gaplar ortidagi faktlarga qaraylik.

27
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:29,930
Rossiya Ukrainaga keng ko‘lamli bosqinni 2022-yil 24-fevralda boshlagan.

28
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,430
O‘shandan beri to‘rt yilu to‘qqiz oy o‘tdi.

29
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:35,970
Bu Ikkinchi jahon urushidan keyin Yevropadagi eng yirik urush.

30
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:40,130
Ko‘plab harbiy tahlilchilar Moskva o‘shanda tez g‘alabani kutgan deb hisoblaydi.

31
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:42,330
Tramp aynan shunga ishora qilmoqda.

32
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,570
Ammo bu gapning ikkinchi tomoni ham bor.

33
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:47,810
2023-yilda, saylov kampaniyasi paytida,

34
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:51,850
Trampning o‘zi Ukrainadagi urushni bir kunda hal qilishini va’da qilgan.

35
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:55,070
Keyinchalik bu gapni hazil sifatida aytganini tan oldi.

36
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:58,870
Ya’ni «bir kun» iborasi Trampning o‘z va’dasiga ham borib taqaladi.

37
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:02,130
Matbuot anjumanida Tramp yana bir da’voni takrorladi.

38
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:07,770
U 2020-yilgi saylov soxtalashtirilmaganida bu urush umuman boshlanmasligini aytdi.

39
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,310
Va Putin ham shunday deganini qo‘shimcha qildi.

40
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,830
Shuni aniq aytish kerak:

41
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:16,310
2020-yilgi saylov soxtalashtirilgani haqidagi da’voni Amerika sudlari ham,

42
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:18,130
rasmiy tekshiruvlar ham tasdiqlamagan.

43
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:21,210
Jurnalistlar «Putin Amerika xalqining do‘stimi?»

44
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:24,650
deb so‘raganida, Tramp Amerika nomidan gapira olmasligini aytdi.

45
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:29,170
Lekin Putin bilan munosabatlari ajoyib ekanini, bu yaxshi narsa ekanini ta’kidladi.

46
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:32,010
Xo‘sh, bu so‘zlar nega hozir bunchalik muhim?

47
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:35,410
Chunki tinchlik jarayoni hal qiluvchi bosqichga kirmoqda.

48
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:41,190
Reuters xabariga ko‘ra, to‘qqiz oylik tanaffusdan keyin shu oy Abu-Dabida muzokaralar qayta boshlangan.

49
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:46,370
Amerika vakillari endi Yevropani ham to‘laqonli hamkor sifatida jarayonga qo‘shishini e’lon qildi.

50
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:48,990
Lekin asosiy to‘siq joyida turibdi.

51
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:51,190
Putin Ukraina butun Donbassdan

52
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:53,110
qo‘shinlarini olib chiqishi kerak degan talabdan qaytmagan.

53
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,290
Kiyev buni qat’iyan rad etadi.

54
00:02:55,320 --> 00:03:00,230
Putin esa payshanba kuni Kiyev va Yevropani murosaga tayyor emaslikda aybladi.

55
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,110
Frontda ham sokinlik yo‘q.

56
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:04,610
Shu hafta Rossiya Kiyevni bombardimon qildi.

57
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,650
Qrim ko‘prigiga zarba berildi

58
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,510
va Putin bunga javob qaytarishini aytdi.

59
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:12,490
Zelenskiy Rossiya Krivoy Rogga yana hujum qilganini ma’lum qildi.

60
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:16,330
Ukraina tomoni Trampning optimizmiga ehtiyotkorlik bilan qaramoqda.

61
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:19,930
Zelenskiy shanba kuni jurnalistlarga Putinning murosaga tayyorligiga

62
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:21,190
amerikaliklarga qaraganda

63
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,990
ancha ko‘proq shubha bilan qarashini aytdi.

64
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,850
Endi eng muhim savol:

65
00:03:24,820 --> 00:03:25,990
keyin nima bo‘ladi?

66
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:29,490
Zelenskiy ma’lumotiga ko‘ra, Vashington Rojdestvodan oldin

67
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:32,130
uch tomonlama muzokaralarning yangi bosqichini o‘tkazmoqchi.

68
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:35,970
Avval milliy xavfsizlik maslahatchilari kun tartibini kelishib oladi.

69
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,910
Keyin sana va joy belgilanadi.

70
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,490
Yana bir muhim sana bor.

71
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:43,330
14–15-dekabr kunlari Mayamida «Katta yigirmatalik»,

72
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:44,870
ya’ni G20 sammiti bo‘ladi.

73
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,290
Zelenskiy u yerga borishga va Putin bilan

74
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:49,410
to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri uchrashishga tayyor ekanini aytdi.

75
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:51,190
Ammo Ukraina hozircha

76
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:52,270
uchrashuvga rasmiy taklif olmagan.

77
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,870
Amerikaning The Atlantic jurnali yozishicha,

78
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:58,390
Tramp aynan Mayami sammitida tinchlik bitimiga erishishni istaydi.

79
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,250
Jurnal bu Kiyevga hududiy yon berish

80
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:03,790
uchun bosim kuchayishini anglatishi mumkinligini ham yozgan.

81
00:04:04,090 --> 00:04:06,430
Ammo bu hozircha faqat matbuot xabari.

82
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,090
Rasmiy reja e’lon qilinmagan.

83
00:04:08,610 --> 00:04:11,290
Bu O‘zbekiston uchun ham befarq mavzu emas.

84
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:14,630
Rossiya mamlakatimizning eng yirik savdo hamkorlaridan biri.

85
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:16,810
Ko‘plab yurtdoshlarimiz u yerda mehnat qiladi.

86
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:19,350
Urushning davom etishi ham, tugashi ham

87
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,030
sanksiyalar, valyuta kursi,

88
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,830
yuk tashish yo‘llari va narxlar orqali

89
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,750
bizning iqtisodiyotimizga ta’sir qiladi.

90
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:28,490
Xulosa qilib aytganda, Trampning gapi keskin va esda qoladigan.

91
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:30,530
Lekin bu gaplar hali tinchlik degani emas.

92
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,570
Bir tomonda Putinning diplomatik

93
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:34,170
yechimga tayyorligi haqidagi so‘zlar.

94
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:36,950
Boshqa tomonda o‘zgarmagan hududiy talablar,

95
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,390
davom etayotgan zarbalar

96
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:40,530
va bir-biriga ishonmaydigan ikki yetakchi.

97
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,750
Keyingi bir oyda Mayamida

98
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,510
yoki Rojdestvodan oldin tomonlar

99
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,830
bir stol atrofida o‘tirishi mumkin.

100
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:48,190
Ammo bir kunda tugashi kerak bo‘lgan bu urush

101
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,810
bitta uchrashuvda tugaydimi?

102
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:51,230
Siz nima deb o‘ylaysiz?

103
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:54,230
Yil oxirigacha Ukrainada tinchlik bitimi imzolanishi mumkinmi?

104
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:56,070
Fikringizni izohlarda yozing.

